  "solution": "**Given, **\n\nK% of 280 = 50% of 350 \n\n**Concept used:**\n\nSimplify L.H.S. = R.H.S.\n\n**Calculation: **\n\n(K/100) × 280 = (50/100) × 350 \n\n⇒ K = (50 × 350 × 100)/(100 × 280) \n\n⇒ K = (50 × 350)/280 \n\n⇒ K = (50 × 5)/4 = 250/4 \n\n⇒ K = 62.5 \n\n**∴ The value of K is 62.5.**",
